         </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-tabs__content m-product-collapsible\">\n        <div\n          class=\"m-tab-content--how-to-install m-tab-content active\"\n          data-block-type=\"how-to-use\"\n          style=\"opacity: 1\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"m-tab-content__inner\">\n            <div class=\"rte\">\n              <div class=\"intab\">\n<img\n                  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/how-to-use.png?v=1726899902\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                />\n                <div class=\"installation-instructions\">\n                  <h1>How To Use?</h1>\n                  <ul>\n                    <li>\n                      Unbox the Scale-O Nano Package received in the parcel.\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Take 0.5 L to 1 L of water from any tap in the house and\n                      insert the product\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Ensure module is fully submerged in water for 5 minutes\n                      and then use the tiny rope to pull out\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Keep the water sample ready for Boiling Test and dispose\n                      the product responsibly\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div\n          class=\"m-tab-content--how-to-clean m-tab-content\"\n          data-block-type=\"how-to-test\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"m-tab-content__inner\">\n            <div class=\"rte\">\n              <div class=\"intab\">\n<div style=\"width: 52%\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 40%\"\n                    src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/how-to-test-before.png?v=1721994904\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 40%\"\n                    src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/how-to-test-after.png?v=1721994905\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"installation-instructions\">\n                  <h1>How To Test?</h1>\n                  <ul>\n                    <li>\n                      To test the water quality and check the performance of the\n                      Scale-O Nano, a simple 10 -minute boiling test can be\n                      performed at home or premises\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Take two equal volume of water samples, 0.5 L to 1 L each\n                      in two separate cooking stainless steel vessels- Sample 1\n                      from the nearest tap water as suitable and Sample 2 is\n                      where Scale-O Nano was immersed\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li>\n                      Boil both samples of water parallelly in two separate\n                      vessels for 5 minutes until water vapour is visible and\n                      allow the liquids to cool down for next 5 minutes\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Sample 1 or Source Water will be turbid and with whitish\n                      layer on top indicating hardness and presence of scale\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Sample 2 or Soft Water will be clean and transparent\n                      without any white deposits indicating softness and absence\n                      of scale\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Boiling Test is easy, quick and definite method to check\n                      water softening without any laboratory apparatus or\n                      complex tests and can be conducted instantly at home\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div\n          class=\"m-tab-content--when-to-replace m-tab-content\"\n          data-block-type=\"when-to-replace\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"m-tab-content__inner\">\n            <div class=\"rte\">\n              <div class=\"intab\">\n                <div class=\"installation-instructions\">\n                  <h1>What Next?</h1>\n                  <ul>\n                    <li>\n                      Once you are satisfied with Trial using Scale-O Nano, you\n                      can expect the same results on a larger scale for your\n                      house or property with our range of Water Softeners\n                    </li>\n                    <li>The technology, concept and application is the same</li>\n                    <li>\n                      Imagine if test gives clear results in 15 minutes, the\n                      same boiling test conducted after few days to few months\n                      shall yield even better results\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Once can observe consistently good soft and clean water\n                      quality with our range of products over the guaranteed\n                      period\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                      Boiling Test Results are guaranteed for any chosen product\n                      or plans\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</m-product-details-tabs>",
